<AI_Verification_Methods_Evaluation>
├── <evaluation_scope>
│   ├── [focuses_on] <verification_of_AI_generated_legal_output>
│   └── [asks] <is_reliable_and_scalable_verification_possible?>
│
├── <tested_methods>
│   ├── <database_lookup>
│   │   ├── [function] <check_case_existence>
│   │   ├── [detects] <fake_cases>
│   │   ├── [effectiveness] <60_percent_of_hallucinations>
│   │   ├── [time_cost] <low>
│   │   └── [fails_to_detect] <fake_holdings_and_reasoning>
│   │
│   ├── <read_actual_opinions>
│   │   ├── [function] <human_primary_source_review>
│   │   ├── [detects] <nearly_all_errors>
│   │   ├── [effectiveness] <95_percent>
│   │   ├── [time_cost] <very_high>
│   │   └── [negates] <AI_efficiency_benefits>
│   │
│   ├── <cross_reference_AI_tools>
│   │   ├── [function] <compare_multiple_AI_outputs>
│   │   ├── [failure_mode] <divergent_hallucinations>
│   │   ├── [effectiveness] <40_percent>
│   │   └── [time_cost] <medium>
│   │
│   └── <shepardizing>
│       ├── [function] <check_citation_history>
│       ├── [verifies] <precedential_status>
│       ├── [does_not_verify] <legal_reasoning>
│       ├── [effectiveness] <30_percent>
│       └── [time_cost] <low>
│
├── <comparative_table>
│   ├── <database_lookup> → (<60_percent>, <low_cost>)
│   ├── <read_actual_opinions> → (<95_percent>, <very_high_cost>)
│   ├── <cross_reference_AI_tools> → (<40_percent>, <medium_cost>)
│   └── <shepardizing> → (<30_percent>, <low_cost>)
│
├── <constraint_analysis>
│   ├── [requires] <high_accuracy>
│   ├── [requires] <low_time_cost>
│   └── [reveals] <tradeoff_between_accuracy_and_scalability>
│
├── <negative_result>
│   ├── [states] <no_method_is_both_reliable_and_scalable>
│   └── [denies_existence_of] <perfect_verification_method>
│
└── <systemic_conclusion>
    ├── [observes] <technology_outpaced_safeguards>
    ├── [creates] <verification_gap>
    └── [leads_to] <unavoidable_professional_risk>
